  "specId": "345-required-hook-failure-policy",
  "issue": 469,
  "request": "#469 — Define a fail-closed contract for required plugin hooks. Scope: flow command hook discovery, registration, snapshots, execution outcomes, caller handling, and focused tests. Required hooks fail closed with typed failures and no partial durable effects; advisory hooks may continue with warnings, issue logs, and follow-ups. Validate missing or unknown policy and runtime integrity failures; remove caller-side scanning of PLUGIN_HOOK_FAILED warnings, including finalize-cleanup's special case. Out of scope: legacy shell hooks, broad plugin framework redesign, workflow artifact schemas, and board API.",
